--- !u!114 &2088487219
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2088487217}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=150%><b>Udon Graphing Calculator</b></size>\nA Desmos-style graphing
    calculator that runs entirely inside VRChat. Type equations, drag sliders and
    explore graphs together. Everyone in the instance sees the same board.\n\n<b><color=#8fb8ff>Getting
    started</color></b>\n\u2022 Tap a row in the <b>Expressions</b> list to select
    it, then type on the keypad below the board.\n\u2022 <b>123</b>, <b>abc</b> and
    <b>func</b> switch keypad pages. Or tap <i>Tap to type with keyboard</i> to use
    VRChat's keyboard.\n\u2022 <b>Enter</b> adds a row, <b>DEL</b> on an empty row
    removes it, <b>\u2191 \u2193</b> move between rows.\n\u2022 The coloured circle
    shows/hides a graph; <b>color</b> changes its colour.\n\n<b><color=#8fb8ff>Things
    to try</color></b>\n<color=#ffd27f>y = x^2</color>   <color=#ffd27f>x^2 + y^2
    = 9</color>   <color=#ffd27f>y < sin(x)</color>\n<color=#ffd27f>r = 1 + cos(\u03B8)</color>  
    <color=#ffd27f>(cos(t), sin(t))</color>\n<color=#ffd27f>a = 2</color>  \u2192
    a slider; use <i>a</i> in other rows\n<color=#ffd27f>f(x) = x^3</color>, then
    <color=#ffd27f>y = f'(x)</color>\n<color=#ffd27f>\u222B_0^1 x^2 dx</color>  
    <color=#ffd27f>\u03A3_{n=1}^{10} n</color>   <color=#ffd27f>mean([1...10])</color>\n<b>+
    table</b>, then <color=#ffd27f>y_1 ~ m x_1 + b</color> for a best-fit line\n\n<b><color=#8fb8ff>Graph
    controls</color></b>\nDrag the graph to pan \xB7 <b>+ / \u2212</b> zoom \xB7
    <b>\u2302</b> reset view\n<b>C</b> complex numbers \xB7 <b>RAD/DEG</b> angle
    mode \xB7 <b>Grid</b> \xB7 <b>Undo / Redo</b>\n\n<b><color=#8fb8ff>Sharing</color></b>\nWhoever
    presses a key takes control of the board. <b>Lock</b> keeps editing to the current
    editor until they unlock it."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
